 'Oesophageal irritation']::text[], ARRAY['Severe oesophageal ulceration', 'Intracranial hypertension (rare)']::text[], ARRAY['Antacids and iron/calcium (reduced absorption)', 'Warfarin', 'Retinoids']::text[], NULL, ARRAY['Response to therapy', 'Signs of photosensitivity']::text[], NULL, NULL, 'Contraindicated in pregnancy.', 'Generally avoided; seek medical advice.', 'Generally avoided under 8 years except in specific serious infections.', 'Usually well tolerated.', 'No routine adjustment needed.', 'Caution in hepatic impairment.', ARRAY['Good oral bioavailability', 'Useful in atypical and rickettsial infections']::text[], ARRAY['Photosensitivity', 'Not for pregnancy or young children']::text[], ARRAY['Take with a full glass of water and remain upright', 'Use sun protection']::text[], '"-cycline → 30S ribosome; avoid in pregnancy and small children."', '-cycline', 'dox-i-SY-kleen', 'डॉक्सी-साइ-क्लीन', NULL, 'active', 'verified', '2026-08-18', '1.0', '2026-08-18T16:51:42.755036+00:00', '2026-08-18T16:51:42.755036+00:00') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
