 required', 'Warfarin INR may fall after the course']::text[], ARRAY['Fatigue', 'Hiccups', 'Constipation', 'Loss of appetite']::text[], ARRAY['Severe hypersensitivity reactions', 'Stevens-Johnson syndrome (rare)']::text[], ARRAY['Dexamethasone', 'Warfarin', 'Hormonal contraceptives', 'Other CYP3A4 substrates']::text[], NULL, ARRAY['Emesis control', 'INR in warfarin users']::text[], NULL, NULL, 'Limited data; avoid unless necessary.', 'Not recommended.', 'Paediatric formulations available for chemotherapy use.', 'No routine adjustment.', 'No adjustment usually needed.', 'Avoid in severe impairment.', ARRAY['Controls delayed emesis that 5-HT3 blockers miss']::text[], ARRAY['Significant CYP3A4 interactions', 'Cost']::text[], ARRAY['"-pitant" marks NK1 antagonists', 'Used as part of a triple antiemetic regimen']::text[], '"-pitant" → NK1 blocker; stops substance P. Learning aid — exceptions exist.', '-pitant', 'a-PREP-i-tant', 'ऐ-प्रे-पि-टैन्ट', '/əˈprɛpɪtænt/', 'active', 'verified', '2026-09-04', '3.0', '2026-09-04T05:57:04.600691+00:00', '2026-09-04T05:57:04.600691+00:00') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
