ention']::text[], ARRAY['Other QT-prolonging drugs', 'CNS depressants', 'Anticholinergics']::text[], NULL, ARRAY['ECG where QT risk exists', 'Sedation level']::text[], NULL, NULL, 'Avoid, particularly in early pregnancy.', 'Not recommended.', 'Dose by weight; avoid in neonates.', 'Avoid where possible due to anticholinergic burden.', 'Reduce dose in impairment.', 'Reduce dose in impairment.', ARRAY['Useful when itching disturbs sleep']::text[], ARRAY['Sedating and anticholinergic', 'QT risk']::text[], ARRAY['First-generation antihistamine', 'Parent compound of cetirizine']::text[], 'Hydroxyzine = "itch plus anxiety, with sleepiness". Learning aid — exceptions exist.', NULL, 'hye-DROX-i-zeen', 'हाइ-ड्रॉक्-सी-ज़ीन', '/haɪˈdrɒksɪziːn/', 'active', 'verified', '2026-09-04', '3.0', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
