cute angle-closure glaucoma', 'Urinary retention', 'Paradoxical bronchospasm']::text[], ARRAY['Other anticholinergic drugs']::text[], NULL, ARRAY['Symptom control', 'Anticholinergic side effects']::text[], NULL, NULL, 'Limited data; use if benefit outweighs risk.', 'Limited data.', 'Approved for asthma in children in some formulations.', 'Watch anticholinergic effects.', 'Caution if creatinine clearance below 50 mL/min.', 'No adjustment needed.', ARRAY['Once-daily dosing', 'Reduces COPD exacerbations']::text[], ARRAY['Dry mouth', 'Not for acute relief']::text[], ARRAY['"-tropium" identifies inhaled antimuscarinics', 'LAMA cornerstone of COPD therapy']::text[], '"-tropium" → anticholinergic inhaler; dry mouth is the clue. Learning aid — exceptions exist.', '-tropium', 'tye-oh-TROH-pee-um', 'टाइ-ओ-ट्रो-पि-अम', '/ˌtaɪoʊˈtroʊpiəm/', 'active', 'verified', '2026-09-04', '3.0', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
