 'Increased pneumonia risk in COPD']::text[], ARRAY['Rinse mouth after inhalation', 'Use the lowest effective dose']::text[], ARRAY['Oral thrush', 'Hoarseness', 'Throat irritation', 'Epistaxis with nasal spray']::text[], ARRAY['Adrenal suppression', 'Growth suppression in children at high dose', 'Pneumonia in COPD']::text[], ARRAY['Ritonavir and other strong CYP3A4 inhibitors', 'Ketoconazole']::text[], NULL, ARRAY['Asthma control', 'Growth in children', 'Oral cavity examination']::text[], NULL, NULL, 'Inhaled corticosteroids are generally continued in pregnancy.', 'Considered compatible.', 'Widely used; monitor growth.', 'No routine adjustment.', 'No adjustment.', 'Systemic exposure may rise in severe impairment.', ARRAY['Effective anti-inflammatory control', 'Low systemic exposure at usual doses']::text[], ARRAY['Local candidiasis', 'Requires regular use to work']::text[], ARRAY['Controller, not reliever', 'Rinse mouth after each dose']::text[], 'ICS = "prevent, not rescue"; rinse your mouth. Learning aid — exceptions exist.', '-sone / -onide', 'floo-TIK-a-sone', 'फ्लू-टि-का-सोन', '/fluːˈtɪkəsoʊn/', 'active', 'verified', '2026-09-04', '3.0', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
