void smoking status changes without dose review', 'Do not crush sustained-release tablets']::text[], ARRAY['Nausea', 'Insomnia', 'Tremor', 'Palpitations']::text[], ARRAY['Seizures', 'Ventricular arrhythmias', 'Severe vomiting from toxicity']::text[], ARRAY['Ciprofloxacin and erythromycin (raise levels)', 'Rifampicin and smoking (lower levels)', 'Cimetidine']::text[], NULL, ARRAY['Serum theophylline level', 'Heart rate', 'Symptoms of toxicity']::text[], NULL, NULL, 'Use only when necessary; monitor levels.', 'Passes into milk; may irritate the infant.', 'Doses differ markedly by age; monitor levels.', 'Clearance falls; reduce dose.', 'No major adjustment.', 'Reduce dose in impairment.', ARRAY['Oral add-on bronchodilator', 'Inexpensive']::text[], ARRAY['Narrow therapeutic index', 'Many drug interactions']::text[], ARRAY['Requires serum level monitoring', 'Levels heavily interaction-dependent']::text[], 'Theophylline = "narrow window" drug — check the level. Learning aid — exceptions exist.', '-phylline', 'thee-OFF-i-lin', 'थी-ऑफ़-ि-लिन', '/θiˈɒfɪlɪn/', 'active', 'verified', '2026-09-04', '3.0', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
