sed use in asthma']::text[], ARRAY['Dilute intravenous doses appropriately', 'Unpleasant sulphur odour is expected']::text[], ARRAY['Nausea', 'Vomiting', 'Rash', 'Unpleasant taste']::text[], ARRAY['Anaphylactoid reaction', 'Bronchospasm']::text[], ARRAY['Activated charcoal (may reduce oral absorption)', 'Nitroglycerin (enhanced hypotension)']::text[], NULL, ARRAY['Infusion reactions', 'Liver function in overdose management']::text[], NULL, NULL, 'Used in pregnancy when treating paracetamol overdose.', 'Considered acceptable.', 'Used in children with weight-based dosing.', 'No routine adjustment.', 'No routine adjustment.', 'Used therapeutically in hepatic injury from paracetamol.', ARRAY['Life-saving antidote in paracetamol poisoning', 'Useful mucolytic']::text[], ARRAY['Infusion reactions', 'Poor taste and odour']::text[], ARRAY['Two roles: mucolytic and paracetamol antidote', 'Earlier antidote administration gives better outcomes']::text[], 'NAC = "unblocks mucus and rescues the liver". Learning aid — exceptions exist.', NULL, 'a-se-til-SIS-teen', 'ऐ-से-टिल-सिस्-टीन', '/əˌsiːtɪlˈsɪstiːn/', 'active', 'verified', '2026-09-04', '3.0', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
