laxis', 'Clostridioides difficile colitis']::text[], ARRAY['Probenecid (raises levels)', 'Methotrexate']::text[], NULL, ARRAY['Clinical response', 'Signs of allergy']::text[], NULL, NULL, 'Considered safe in pregnancy.', 'Considered compatible.', 'Widely used with weight-based dosing.', 'No routine adjustment.', 'Reduce frequency in severe impairment.', 'No adjustment.', ARRAY['Narrow spectrum limits resistance pressure', 'Long safety record']::text[], ARRAY['Frequent dosing', 'Not active against beta-lactamase producers']::text[], ARRAY['Drug of choice for strep throat', 'Key agent in rheumatic fever prophylaxis']::text[], 'Penicillin V = "V for oral strep throat". Learning aid — exceptions exist.', '-cillin', 'pen-i-SIL-in vee', 'पे-नि-सि-लिन वी', '/ˌpɛnɪˈsɪlɪn/', 'active', 'verified', '2026-09-04', '3.0', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
