hoea', 'Rash']::text[], ARRAY['Cholestatic jaundice', 'Anaphylaxis', 'C. difficile colitis']::text[], ARRAY['Probenecid', 'Methotrexate', 'Warfarin (variable effect)']::text[], NULL, ARRAY['Liver function in prolonged courses', 'Clinical response']::text[], NULL, NULL, 'Considered acceptable when indicated.', 'Considered compatible.', 'Weight-based paediatric dosing.', 'Higher hepatic risk; monitor.', 'Reduce dose in severe impairment.', 'Avoid with previous flucloxacillin liver injury.', ARRAY['Reliable anti-staphylococcal cover', 'Good bone penetration']::text[], ARRAY['Four-times-daily dosing', 'Cholestatic liver injury risk']::text[], ARRAY['Anti-staphylococcal penicillin', 'Ineffective against MRSA']::text[], 'Flucloxacillin = "the staph penicillin" — but not for MRSA. Learning aid — exceptions exist.', '-cillin', 'floo-klox-a-SIL-in', 'फ्लू-क्लॉक्-सा-सि-लिन', '/ˌfluːklɒksəˈsɪlɪn/', 'active', 'verified', '2026-09-04', '3.0', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00', '2026-09-04T05:59:20.108608+00:00') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
